1. Given : <input type="text" placeholder="Username">
what i return in typescript : await page.getByRole('textbox' ).fill('kirti') // Playwright will throw a Strict Mode Violation because it found 2 textboxes.
corrected ans : using getByLabel()
await page.getByPlaceholder('Username').fill('Kirti');
or using locator 
await page.locator('#username').fill('Kirti');
or attributes
await page.locator('[placeholder="Username"]').fill('Kirti'); // but not recommended much


